  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5t + 3u) ∶ (5t - 3u) = 5 ∶ 3\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nFor ratios (a)/(b) = (c)/(d) , then a × d = b × c\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n((5t + 3u))/((5t - 3u)) = (5)/(3)\n\n⇒ 3(5t + 3u) = 5(5t - 3u)\n\n⇒ 15t + 9u = 25t - 15u\n\n⇒ 15u + 9u = 25t - 15t\n\n⇒ 24u = 10t\n\n⇒ t ∶ u = (24)/(10) = 12 ∶ 5\n\n**The value of t ∶ u is 12 ∶ 5.**",
